  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The context",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "Quechua’s designers asked me to help redesign the 2‑second tent, the one that pops open when you throw it. On paper, its users are campers and hikers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The question",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Who actually lives in this tent?",
            "Designed as an escape. For some, it’s a refuge.",
            "Outdoor, but make it indoor."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I did",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Photographed about twenty 2‑second tents in the city, used by homeless people and migrants",
            "Followed the thread to other Decathlon products that help people get through the street: delivery riders’ bikes, thermal gloves"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The series",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "custom",
          "html": "<div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Photographs to add: the 2‑second tent series\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 5 / 2; max-width: 640px; border-radius: 16px; background: #F2F2F5; border: 1px dashed #A9ACBA; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #4A4A57\">[PHOTOS]</div>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What changed",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "Nothing, officially: it wasn’t the direction the team wanted to take. The question is still open."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What I’d do next",
      "long_title": false,
      "wrap": "pretty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "style": "plain",
          "text": "Hand out disposable cameras through an NGO, so the people who live in these tents can photograph their own use. Then show it to designers under one title: <span style=\"font-family: Newsreader, Georgia, serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 1.15em\">We are users too.</span>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
